<view class="page">
  <view class="page-head"><view class="row"><text class="page-title">共享服务</text><text class="demo-badge">机制模拟</text></view><view class="page-sub">{{selected.name || '正在加载'}} · 共享有规则，记录可查</view></view>
  <view class="filter-scroll"><button wx:for="{{tabKeys}}" wx:key="*this" class="filter-button {{section === item ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="section">{{tabLabels[index]}}</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loadError}}" class="load-error">{{loadError}}<button class="secondary space" bindtap="refresh">重新加载</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!ready && !loadError}}" class="panel loading-state">正在读取联盟记录…</view>
  <block wx:if="{{ready}}">
    <block wx:if="{{section === 'rights'}}">
      <view class="panel"><view class="section-title">贡献积分 {{selected.points}}</view><view class="list-note">逐笔记入模拟台账，自获得之日起12个月有效。1积分抵扣1元平台仓储服务费，不抵扣供给方收入；均为模拟结算。</view><view wx:for="{{alliance.monthly}}" wx:key="month" class="list-note">{{item.month}}获得积分：{{item.earned}}（含期初迁移）</view><view wx:for="{{alliance.ledger}}" wx:key="id" class="list-row"><view class="row"><text class="grow small">{{item.reason}}</text><text class="number">{{item.points}}</text></view><view class="list-note">已用{{item.used}} · {{item.expiry}}到期 · {{item.expired ? '已过期' : '有效'}}</view></view></view>
      <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">保底承诺</text><text class="section-note">{{selected.guarantee}}m³</text></view>
      <view class="form-section"><view class="list-note">{{alliance.membership.basis}}</view><form bindsubmit="guarantee"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">历史企业：填写12个月用量（m³，逗号分隔）</text><input class="input" name="months" maxlength="180" placeholder="如：100,120,…，共12个数"/></view><view class="field-hint">历史月均用量×80%核定；留空则按下方新企业计划申请。</view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">新企业生产计划核定库容 / m³</text><input class="input" name="volume" type="digit" placeholder="填写模拟计划库容"/></view><view class="switch-row"><text class="grow">模拟联盟审核已确认计划</text><switch name="approved" color="#096C9C"/></view><button class="secondary" form-type="submit" disabled="{{busy}}">核定模拟保底额度</button></form><view class="field-hint">资质条件按比赛场景预设；此处不是实际企业审核。</view></view>
      <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">费用与收益账单</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{!alliance.bills.length}}" class="panel empty">提交预约并履约后可查看模拟账单。</view>
      <view wx:for="{{alliance.bills}}" wx:key="id" class="panel space"><view class="order-id">{{item.id}}</view><view class="key-value"><text>仓储费</text><text>¥{{item.storage}}</text></view><view class="key-value"><text>供给方80% / 平台20%</text><text>¥{{item.storageProvider}} / ¥{{item.storagePlatform}}</text></view><view class="key-value"><text>已完成批次运费</text><text>¥{{item.transport}}</text></view><view class="key-value"><text>积分抵扣 / 合计</text><text>−¥{{item.discount}} / ¥{{item.total}}</text></view><view class="list-note">{{item.settled ? '模拟履约完成，可办理抵扣' : '预估账单，履约后可抵扣'}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.settled && !item.discount}}" class="secondary space" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="redeem" disabled="{{busy || !selected.points}}">用积分抵扣仓储服务费</button></view>
      <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">联盟规则</text></view><view class="panel"><view class="list-note">准入：企业许可、GSP承诺、冷库年检与完整温湿度记录；车辆需运输资质、采集终端及GPS。演示中按预设条件匹配，不替代真实核验。</view><view class="divider"/><view class="list-note">平台统一质量管控；硬件故障由供给企业联合承保方担责；调度失误由运营主体担责。年度二次分红向积分前20%企业倾斜，实际资金池尚未接入，不生成虚假分红金额。</view><view class="divider"/><view class="list-note">{{alliance.membership.status === 'active' ? '当前为模拟联盟成员，可提前30天申请退出。' : '已申请退出，生效日期：' + alliance.exitDate}} 未过期积分保留；退出后取消保底，仍可按需付费预约及抵扣未过期积分。</view><button class="outline space" bindtap="exit" disabled="{{busy || alliance.membership.status !== 'active'}}">申请30天后模拟退出</button></view>
    </block>
    <block wx:if="{{section === 'trace'}}">
      <view class="form-section"><view class="section-title">全流程模拟档案</view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">订单号 / 模拟追溯码</text><input class="input" value="{{query}}" bindinput="inputQuery" placeholder="输入当前工作区订单号"/></view><view class="detail-actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="lookup">查询档案</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="scan">扫码查询</button></view><view class="field-hint">扫码内容为订单号；不同设备的模拟数据不互通。</view><view wx:if="{{traceError}}" class="field-error">{{traceError}}</view></view>
      <view wx:if="{{trace}}" class="panel"><view class="section-title">{{trace.id}}</view><view class="list-note">{{trace.companyName}} · {{trace.temp}} · {{trace.statusText}}</view><view class="notice info space">存证状态：未接联盟链。以下为本机模拟档案，不提供链上核验或监管报送证明。</view><view wx:for="{{trace.history}}" wx:key="index" class="list-row small">{{index + 1}}. {{item.message}}</view><button wx:if="{{trace.enterpriseId === selected.id && (trace.status === 'stored' || trace.status === 'shipping')}}" class="danger space" bindtap="alert" disabled="{{busy}}">演示严重超温告警</button></view>
      <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">告警处置工单</text><text class="section-note">模拟闭环</text></view><view wx:if="{{!alliance.alerts.length}}" class="panel empty">查询已入库订单后，可演示告警、响应、处置和归档。</view><view wx:for="{{alliance.alerts}}" wx:key="id" class="panel space"><view class="row"><text class="grow small">{{item.orderId}} · {{item.level}}</text><text class="tag amber">{{item.statusText}}</text></view><view class="list-note">模拟异常样本{{item.temperature}}℃</view><view wx:for="{{item.steps}}" wx:for-item="step" wx:key="index" class="list-row small">{{step.message}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.status !== 'archived'}}" class="secondary space" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="advance" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.actionText}}</button></view>
      <view class="notice info space">方案目标：库内采集间隔≤5分钟，车载≤2分钟；离线缓存补传与至少5年留存。本版未接传感器、消息推送、监管接口或长期存储，不将演示记录视为GSP合规证明。</view>
    </block>
    <block wx:if="{{section === 'forecast'}}"><view class="notice info">当前仓储采用保底预留＋加权分配，车辆采用约束筛选匹配；未接入方案第五章GA／VRPTW求解器。未来7天供需按当前登记订单及资源时段逐日推演，不是机器学习预测；尚未录入的需求不包含在内。</view><view wx:for="{{alliance.forecast}}" wx:key="index" class="panel space"><view class="row"><text class="small">{{item.date}} · {{item.temp}}</text><text class="tag {{item.tight ? 'amber' : 'teal'}}">{{item.tight ? '建议错峰' : '可预约'}}</text></view><view class="key-value"><text>登记需求 / 可用余量</text><text>{{item.demand}} / {{item.free}}m³</text></view></view></block>
  </block>
  <view class="demo-foot">管理机制演示 · 无真实资金结算或企业审核</view>
</view>
